IEconomicDiscussionSearchFilters.description:
Dynamic key-value mapping of applied search filters such as category codes, date ranges, status values and other search criteria.

Flexible filter structure that supports various filtering options for economic discussion content search operations while maintaining type safety and extensibility for future filter additions.

The filter system allows clients to specify arbitrary key-value pairs where keys represent filter types (category, dateRange, status, etc.) and values contain the actual filter criteria. This design enables easy extension with new filter types without requiring schema modifications.

Common filter patterns include:
- Category filtering: {"category": "macroeconomics"}
- Date range filtering: {"dateRange": "2024-01-01,2024-12-31"}
- Status filtering: {"status": "published"}
- Author filtering: {"authorId": "user-123"}
- Tag filtering: {"tags": "inflation,monetary-policy"}

